# Project Polish (#003)

Shift from features to **premium, unforgettable UX**. Standard: Apple / Xbox / Stripe / Linear.

## First 5 seconds (home)

Communicate trust, excitement, community, activity, premium quality.

## Motion

GPU-accelerated, subtle, fluid — never abrupt. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Consistency

One design system: spacing, radius, typography, shadows, button heights, animation timing.

## Empty states

Never blank — encouraging copy + CTA to next experience.

## Loading

Branded messages + skeletons, not generic spinners.

## v1.0 gate

Would a player proudly recommend this screen to a friend?

Full spec: `docs/PROJECT_POLISH.md`
